    "design_review": {
      "approved_by": "design-panel",
      "at": "2026-09-22T12:55:00Z",
      "self_resolved": [
        "DR-001 high: nothing pointed LOGIN_URL at the packaged page, so a zero-configuration project sent an anonymous visitor from a protected page to a 404 \u2014 documented in T010 and proved end to end in T005",
        "DR-002 high: demo/settings.py's LOGOUT_REDIRECT_URL made the packaged signed-out page unreachable in the demo \u2014 the setting is removed in T016 (D12)",
        "DR-003 high: reloading mvp.urls alone reads a stale cached resolver and leaves the process broken for later tests \u2014 T011 now specifies the full fixture, and T012, T013 and T015 use it",
        "DR-004 medium: allauth's own test configuration was left for the Implementer to discover \u2014 T001 now reads it and writes it down before US-2 starts",
        "DR-005 low: a next pointing back at the sign-in page hits Django's own loop detector \u2014 accepted as inherited (D13)",
        "DR-006 low: non-disclosure depends on the project's backend rejecting inactive users \u2014 documented in T010 (D14)"
      ]
    }
  },
